  📗
    The fields of *body*, read as application/x-www-form-urlencoded: pairs
    with & between them, a name and a value with = between them, each with
    its escapes decoded and + for a space. A pair without = is a name with an
    empty value, and a pair without a name is passed over. A form of more
    than *most* fields is not read to its end.
