  📗
    The fields and the files of *body*, read as multipart/form-data: parts
    between lines made of two hyphens and *boundary*, each with headers, an
    empty line, and what the part holds. A part that names a file is a file,
    any other is a value, which has to be text. What stands before the first
    boundary line and after the closing one is passed over. A form of more
    than *most* parts is not read to its end.
