  💭 Whether the parameters of a Content-Disposition, the bytes of *body* from *from* up to
  💭 *to*, have one called *wanted*, a name in lower case. Its value is added to *out*,
  💭 without the quotes it may be in. Within quotes a backslash stands before a quote and
  💭 before a backslash that belong to the value, as curl writes them, and is itself part
  💭 of the value before anything else, as in the paths that old browsers sent for a
  💭 file's name. A value whose quotes are never closed is none: where it ends cannot be
